3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md\">../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> (signature, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (first-order formulas, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (atomic formulas, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ca5c1762b574813b\" href=\"?note=ca5c1762b574813b\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-atomic-formula.md\">../batch06/58-df-atomic-formula.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta,\\varphi, \\psi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\theta,\\varphi, \\psi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (公式)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\chi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> (关系符号)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_1,\\ldots,t_n,s,t \\in \\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(t_1,\\ldots,t_n,s,t \\in \\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (terms, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"db7ec154138d5972\" href=\"?note=db7ec154138d5972\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-term.md\">../batch05/58-df-term.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span> (variables)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{cnst}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}}\">\\(\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{cnst}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_{\\mathrm{fn}}\">\\(a_{\\mathrm{fn}}\\)</span> are the constant-symbol set, function-symbol set, and function-arity map carried by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cnst},\\mathrm{fn}\">\\(\\mathrm{cnst},\\mathrm{fn}\\)</span> are their fixed component tags.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\varphi)\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\varphi)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VarTerm}_\\Sigma(t)\">\\(\\operatorname{VarTerm}_\\Sigma(t)\\)</span> (variable-support operations)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeFor}_\\Sigma(t,x,\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{FreeFor}_\\Sigma(t,x,\\varphi)\\)</span> (capture-avoidance predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"8ad179c98b9a237c\" href=\"?note=8ad179c98b9a237c\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-free-for.md\">../batch06/58-df-free-for.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubTrm}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{SubFml}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{SubstitutionFormula}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SubTrm}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{SubFml}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{SubstitutionFormula}_S\\)</span> (recursive operations and graph predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>当输入为四分量语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 时，使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_L=\\mathrm{FormulaSignatureOf}_S(L)\">\\(\\Sigma_L=\\mathrm{FormulaSignatureOf}_S(L)\\)</span>；以下兼容式不改变公式、项的集合编码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubFml}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{SubFml}_L\\)</span> 的定义域仍要求自由代入条件。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}\">\\(\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md\">../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}term\\text{-}local} \\vdash \\mathrm{SubTrm}_\\Sigma(u,t,x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}t,&amp;u=x,\\\\u,&amp;u\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\setminus\\{x\\}\\lor u\\in\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{cnst}},\\\\f\\bigl(\\mathrm{SubTrm}_\\Sigma(u_1,t,x),\\ldots,\\mathrm{SubTrm}_\\Sigma(u_m,t,x)\\bigr),&amp;u=f(u_1,\\ldots,u_m),\\ f\\in\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},\\ m=a_{\\mathrm{fn}}(f).\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}term\\text{-}local} \\vdash \\mathrm{SubTrm}_\\Sigma(u,t,x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}t,&amp;u=x,\\\\u,&amp;u\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\setminus\\{x\\}\\lor u\\in\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{cnst}},\\\\f\\bigl(\\mathrm{SubTrm}_\\Sigma(u_1,t,x),\\ldots,\\mathrm{SubTrm}_\\Sigma(u_m,t,x)\\bigr),&amp;u=f(u_1,\\ldots,u_m),\\ f\\in\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},\\ m=a_{\\mathrm{fn}}(f).\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}formula} \\vdash \\mathrm{SubstitutionFormula}_S(\\theta,\\varphi,t,x,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow \\varphi,\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\land t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land\\mathrm{FreeFor}_\\Sigma(t,x,\\varphi)\\land\\theta=\\mathrm{SubFml}_\\Sigma(\\varphi,t,x)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}formula} \\vdash \\mathrm{SubstitutionFormula}_S(\\theta,\\varphi,t,x,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow \\varphi,\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\land t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land\\mathrm{FreeFor}_\\Sigma(t,x,\\varphi)\\land\\theta=\\mathrm{SubFml}_\\Sigma(\\varphi,t,x)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}formula\\text{-}recursion} \\vdash \\mathrm{SubFml}_\\Sigma(\\varphi,t,x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\mathrm{SubTrm}_\\Sigma(t_1,t,x)\\doteq\\mathrm{SubTrm}_\\Sigma(t_2,t,x),&amp;\\varphi=(t_1\\doteq t_2),\\\\R\\bigl(\\mathrm{SubTrm}_\\Sigma(t_1,t,x),\\ldots,\\mathrm{SubTrm}_\\Sigma(t_n,t,x)\\bigr),&amp;\\varphi=R(t_1,\\ldots,t_n),\\\\\\neg\\mathrm{SubFml}_\\Sigma(\\psi,t,x),&amp;\\varphi=\\neg\\psi,\\\\\\mathrm{SubFml}_\\Sigma(\\psi,t,x)\\lor\\mathrm{SubFml}_\\Sigma(\\chi,t,x),&amp;\\varphi=(\\psi\\lor\\chi),\\\\\\forall y\\,\\psi,&amp;\\varphi=\\forall y\\,\\psi\\land(y=x\\lor x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\psi)),\\\\\\forall y\\,\\mathrm{SubFml}_\\Sigma(\\psi,t,x),&amp;\\varphi=\\forall y\\,\\psi\\land y\\neq x\\land x\\in\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\psi)\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{VarTerm}_\\Sigma(t).\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}formula\\text{-}recursion} \\vdash \\mathrm{SubFml}_\\Sigma(\\varphi,t,x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\mathrm{SubTrm}_\\Sigma(t_1,t,x)\\doteq\\mathrm{SubTrm}_\\Sigma(t_2,t,x),&amp;\\varphi=(t_1\\doteq t_2),\\\\R\\bigl(\\mathrm{SubTrm}_\\Sigma(t_1,t,x),\\ldots,\\mathrm{SubTrm}_\\Sigma(t_n,t,x)\\bigr),&amp;\\varphi=R(t_1,\\ldots,t_n),\\\\\\neg\\mathrm{SubFml}_\\Sigma(\\psi,t,x),&amp;\\varphi=\\neg\\psi,\\\\\\mathrm{SubFml}_\\Sigma(\\psi,t,x)\\lor\\mathrm{SubFml}_\\Sigma(\\chi,t,x),&amp;\\varphi=(\\psi\\lor\\chi),\\\\\\forall y\\,\\psi,&amp;\\varphi=\\forall y\\,\\psi\\land(y=x\\lor x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\psi)),\\\\\\forall y\\,\\mathrm{SubFml}_\\Sigma(\\psi,t,x),&amp;\\varphi=\\forall y\\,\\psi\\land y\\neq x\\land x\\in\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\psi)\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{VarTerm}_\\Sigma(t).\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L)\\land t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(L)\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\n\\to\\mathrm{SubTrm}_L(u,t,x)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{SubTrm}_{\\mathrm{FormulaSignatureOf}_S(L)}(u,t,x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L)\\land t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(L)\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\n\\to\\mathrm{SubTrm}_L(u,t,x)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{SubTrm}_{\\mathrm{FormulaSignatureOf}_S(L)}(u,t,x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L)\\land t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(L)\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\land\\mathrm{FreeFor}_L(t,x,\\varphi)\n\\to\\mathrm{SubFml}_L(\\varphi,t,x)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{SubFml}_{\\mathrm{FormulaSignatureOf}_S(L)}(\\varphi,t,x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L)\\land t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(L)\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\land\\mathrm{FreeFor}_L(t,x,\\varphi)\n\\to\\mathrm{SubFml}_L(\\varphi,t,x)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{SubFml}_{\\mathrm{FormulaSignatureOf}_S(L)}(\\varphi,t,x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi[t/x]\">\\(\\varphi[t/x]\\)</span> denotes the result of replacing free occurrences of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-formula-substitution</code> is merged here as the same formula-substitution definition.</li>\n<li>项与公式替换均沿 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a> 的有限深度语法递归定义；这里只处理其原始构造子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg,\\lor,\\forall\">\\(\\neg,\\lor,\\forall\\)</span>，派生联结词与存在量词先展开。</li>\n<li>当被替换的变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 等于量词约束的变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 时，替换无效（变量被捕获）</li>\n<li>The two quantified branches are exhaustive under <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeFor}(t,x,\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{FreeFor}(t,x,\\varphi)\\)</span>: substitution stops when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y=x\">\\(y=x\\)</span> or <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> is absent, and otherwise the binder must not occur in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Related-Concepts\">[Related Concepts]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a> — 一阶公式</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"ca5c1762b574813b\" href=\"?note=ca5c1762b574813b\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-atomic-formula.md\">../batch06/58-df-atomic-formula.md</a> — 原子公式</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"1f15e62b2f077e8d\" href=\"?note=1f15e62b2f077e8d\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-substitution-term.md\">../batch12/58-df-substitution-term.md</a> — 项替换</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"8ad179c98b9a237c\" href=\"?note=8ad179c98b9a237c\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-free-for.md\">../batch06/58-df-free-for.md</a> — 自由代入条件</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion",